# Every herdr action the palette lists, one per line, id | mode | title | command. The order
# here is the order they are listed in, so keep each kind of thing together.
#
# The id is herdr's own action name wherever herdr has one, because that is the name its
# [keys] table binds, and the palette shows the key bound to it. An id herdr does not know,
# such as the swaps, simply has no key to show.
#
# The mode says what happens on enter.
#   run      runs the command, a herdr subcommand without the leading herdr
#   confirm  the same after a yes, for anything that closes or removes
#   api      sends one request to herdr's socket, the method then key={placeholder} words, for
#            what herdr's API does and its CLI does not
#   shell    runs the command as a bash script once the popup has closed, for an action that
#            takes more than one herdr call or long enough to hold the popup open, with herdr
#            reached through "$HERDR_BIN_PATH" and the scripts beside this file through
#            "$PALETTE_TOOLS"
#   step     moves to the next or previous space, tab or agent, written as the kind and +1 or -1
#   key      herdr cannot do this from outside its own window, so enter says which key to press,
#            and the row is left out while that key is unbound
#
# The command is everything after the third bar, so a shell command may use pipes. Every
# placeholder becomes exactly one value, so a name with spaces in it stays whole.
#   {pane} {tab} {workspace}  the subject, where the palette was opened, or the selected row
#                             when a key from palette-keys was pressed
#   {cwd}                     the subject pane's directory
#   {input}                   a line of text asked for when it is reached
#   {label}                   the same, starting from the current name of what is renamed
#   {worktree}                picked from the worktrees of the subject space's repository
#   {tab_slot_left}           where the subject tab lands one place left, for tab.move
#   {tab_slot_right}          and one place right
#
# Adding an action is one line here and no change to palette.sh.

new_workspace            | run     | New space                 | workspace create --cwd {cwd} --focus
rename_workspace         | run     | Rename space              | workspace rename {workspace} {label}
close_workspace          | confirm | Close space               | workspace close {workspace}
previous_workspace       | step    | Previous space            | workspace -1
next_workspace           | step    | Next space                | workspace +1
workspace_picker         | key     | Space picker              |

new_tab                  | run     | New tab                   | tab create --workspace {workspace} --cwd {cwd} --focus
rename_tab               | run     | Rename tab                | tab rename {tab} {label}
close_tab                | confirm | Close tab                 | tab close {tab}
previous_tab             | step    | Previous tab              | tab -1
next_tab                 | step    | Next tab                  | tab +1
move_tab_previous        | api     | Move tab left             | tab.move tab_id={tab} insert_index={tab_slot_left}
move_tab_next            | api     | Move tab right            | tab.move tab_id={tab} insert_index={tab_slot_right}

split_vertical           | run     | Split right               | pane split {pane} --direction right --cwd {cwd} --focus
split_horizontal         | run     | Split down                | pane split {pane} --direction down --cwd {cwd} --focus
zoom                     | run     | Zoom pane                 | pane zoom {pane} --toggle
rename_pane              | run     | Rename pane               | pane rename {pane} {label}
clear_pane_name          | run     | Clear pane name           | pane rename {pane} --clear
close_pane               | confirm | Close pane                | pane close {pane}
focus_pane_left          | run     | Focus pane left           | pane focus --direction left --pane {pane}
focus_pane_down          | run     | Focus pane down           | pane focus --direction down --pane {pane}
focus_pane_up            | run     | Focus pane up             | pane focus --direction up --pane {pane}
focus_pane_right         | run     | Focus pane right          | pane focus --direction right --pane {pane}
swap_pane_left           | run     | Swap pane left            | pane swap --direction left --pane {pane}
swap_pane_down           | run     | Swap pane down            | pane swap --direction down --pane {pane}
swap_pane_up             | run     | Swap pane up              | pane swap --direction up --pane {pane}
swap_pane_right          | run     | Swap pane right           | pane swap --direction right --pane {pane}
resize_pane_left         | run     | Resize pane left          | pane resize --direction left --pane {pane}
resize_pane_down         | run     | Resize pane down          | pane resize --direction down --pane {pane}
resize_pane_up           | run     | Resize pane up            | pane resize --direction up --pane {pane}
resize_pane_right        | run     | Resize pane right         | pane resize --direction right --pane {pane}
move_pane_new_tab        | run     | Move pane to a new tab    | pane move {pane} --new-tab --focus
move_pane_new_workspace  | run     | Move pane to a new space  | pane move {pane} --new-workspace --focus
last_pane                | key     | Last pane                 |
cycle_pane_next          | key     | Next pane                 |
cycle_pane_previous      | key     | Previous pane             |
resize_mode              | key     | Resize mode               |
clear_pane               | api     | Clear pane                | pane.clear pane_id={pane}
edit_scrollback          | api     | Edit scrollback           | pane.edit_scrollback pane_id={pane}

previous_agent           | step    | Previous agent            | agent -1
next_agent               | step    | Next agent                | agent +1
prompt_agent             | run     | Prompt agent              | agent prompt {pane} {input}
new_agent                | shell   | New agent                 | "$PALETTE_TOOLS/new-agent.sh" {pane} {cwd} {input} claude

new_worktree             | run     | New worktree from branch  | worktree create --workspace {workspace} --branch {input} --focus
open_worktree            | run     | Open worktree             | worktree open --workspace {workspace} --path {worktree} --focus
remove_worktree          | confirm | Remove worktree           | worktree remove --workspace {workspace}

reload_config            | run     | Reload config             | server reload-config
goto                     | key     | Go to                     |
open_notification_target | key     | Open notification target  |
toggle_sidebar           | key     | Toggle sidebar            |
settings                 | key     | Settings                  |
help                     | key     | Help                      |
detach                   | key     | Detach                    |
